{{- /*
Shared documentation prompt partials. Every documentation prompt template — the
default and each Template override — is parsed together with this file, so it
may call any partial below with {{ template "<name>" . }}. A partial holds text
several templates share (the header, the assignments block, the evidence rules,
the closed-set paragraph), so a change to it is made once; every change moves
the promptSha256 of each type whose template calls it. Nothing outside a define
block is ever rendered.
*/ -}}

